  "body": "Stacked on #1141 and #1136 (both on #1131 -> #560 -> #551). Fork synced at v0.18.0. Effort: medium.\n\n## What changed\n- Machine window: a **Sinker EDM** section for a `sinker_edm` machine (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/machine_edm_editor.rs`): max orbit radius, electrode pickup, the orbit list (geometry + control word), the condition table (id, name, gap, undersize, role) and the seven `edm.codes` roles. Absent values read \"not stated\" (unticked = absent, never zero); causes the loader would refuse are named beside the section (\"Apply will refuse: ...\").\n- Edits go through the existing undoable `EditMachineApply` (one Apply = one undo step), validated at command creation by `Machine::is_sane`. `Edm::is_sane` now also refuses a blank `pickup`, as the file loader already did.\n- Sinker Burn page: reads the typed condition's gap and electrode undersize from the mounted machine (\"not stated\" when absent). The burn / undersize / rough-finish fields already stand in the op-page tabs (#541, #543).\n- **Seam, out of scope:** orbit and side-burn op pages (#544, #545) and the electrode-from-faces button (#547). No snapshot PNG changes.\n- No new command, so no new MCP tool; filed `MCP: edit the mounted machine` as #1162.\n\n## Tests\n- `crates/ui/tests/sinker_setup.rs`: sinker machine + electrode + burn-to-depth set up through the ui queue, a refused machine edit, then undone step by step.\n- `egui_app/sinker_machine_tests.rs` (AccessKit): section shows keys, orbits, conditions, codes and \"not stated\"; absent for a lathe; Add condition + Apply is one undo step; a blank orbit word is named and refused; the burn page reads gap / undersize.\n- Quick gate (`--base upstream/main`): tools, sim, motion, ui suites ok; clippy -D warnings clean on app, post, ui. Three failures come from the stacked parents, not this diff: `recorded_streams::every_shipped_post_script_has_its_suite` (sinker-iso.cps has no suite, #542), `coarse_laws` (SinkerBurn reduced-fidelity row, #541) and `solid_law_goldens` (sinker_burn_cavity.nc not judged). Not exercised: real EDM control, hand check of the pages in the GUI (needs the maintainer's hand check).\n\nChangelog: Sinker EDM machine setup in the Machine window (keys, orbits, conditions, codes) and condition readout on the Sinker Burn page (#548, PR #1165)\n\nFixes #548\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
